# Placeholder Kibana dashboards file.
# The actual dashboards will be exported from Kibana after running docker-compose.
# Instructions:
# 1. Run `docker-compose up` to start Elasticsearch + Kibana.
# 2. In Kibana: Stack Management → Saved Objects → Import.
# 3. Select the exported NDJSON file.
# 4. Dashboards will appear under Analytics → Dashboard.
